     A*  05/04/17 C:180 PROJECT 133WQD                                *
     A*                 ADD NEW RENEWAL FLAG TO INDICATE RENEWAL      *
     A*                 OF A POLICY WITH A DIFFERENT CARRIER NUMBER   *
     A*                 AND CROSS REFERENCED TO ANOTHER GROUP.        *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  09/23/96 C:61 PROJECT 68AVP                                  *
     H*                ADD A FLAG TO INDICATE CANCELLED/REWRITTEN     *
     H*                Y/BLANK                                        *
     H*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PEX01                     TEXT('EMP # CROSS REFERENCE FILE')
     A            EXCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            EXFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            EXEMP#    R               REFFLD(EMP#)
     A            EXDIV     R               REFFLD(DIV)
     A            EXOFND    R               REFFLD(FND)
     A                                      COLHDG('OLD' 'FUND')
     A            EXOEMP    R               REFFLD(EMP#)
     A                                      COLHDG('OLD' 'EMP #')
     A            EXODIV    R               REFFLD(DIV)
     A                                      COLHDG('OLD' 'DIV')
     A            EXUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            EXPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            EXTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            EXDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
     A            EXIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'USER')
     A            EXIDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'DATE')
     A***** BEGIN ADD ***** 09/23/96 **********************************
     A            EXCAR     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('CANCELLED' 'REWRITE')
     A***** END ADD ******* 09/23/96 **********************************
     A***** BEGIN ADD ***** 05/04/17 **********************************
     A            EXRNWL    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('SET AS ' 'RENEWAL FLAG')
     A***** END ADD ******* 05/04/17 **********************************
